<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1457764741"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1801908166"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ミライトレイン"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Breakthrough!(Blu-ray付生産限定盤)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:50.302"><div begin="00:01.895" end="05:50.602"><p begin="00:01.895" end="00:22.929" itunes:key="L1496">(Wo...)</p><p begin="00:29.506" end="00:32.822" itunes:key="L1497">キミに会いに行くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这就去见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni a i ni i ku yo</span></p><p begin="00:32.932" end="00:35.458" itunes:key="L1498">みんなで見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想跟你一道确认</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na de mi te ta</span></p><p begin="00:35.727" end="00:40.214" itunes:key="L1499">夢を確かめたくなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家眼中的那些梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wo ta shi ka me ta ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:40.362" end="00:43.665" itunes:key="L1500">ギターケース抱え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱着吉他盒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gi ta a ke e su ka ka e</span></p><p begin="00:43.775" end="00:47.960" itunes:key="L1501">未来行きの電車 飛び乗った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳上了驶向未来的电车</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i yu ki no de n sha to bi no 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:47.970" end="00:51.068" itunes:key="L1502">息はずませ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心情一飞冲天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ha zu ma se</span></p><p begin="00:50.978" end="00:56.989" itunes:key="L1503">(Wo...)窓の景色 流れゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窗外的景色疾驰而过</span></p><p begin="00:56.496" end="01:02.344" itunes:key="L1504">(Wo...)次の駅が見えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下一站宛然可见</span></p><p begin="01:01.920" end="01:08.093" itunes:key="L1505">(Wo...)キミがホームに立ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅看到你已站在月台</span></p><p begin="01:08.416" end="01:16.975" itunes:key="L1506">ただそれだけで 胸が高鳴るから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心就欢快地跳起了舞来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da so re da ke de mu ne ga ta ka na ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:17.274" end="01:25.700" itunes:key="L1507">同じ景色 見つめながら走り続ける Train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼中是如常的风景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji ke shi ki mi tsu me na ga ra</span></p><p begin="01:25.710" end="01:29.189" itunes:key="L1508">線路は未来へと続く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">铁路带我通向未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi ha mi ra i he to tsu du ku</span></p><p begin="01:29.199" end="01:33.897" itunes:key="L1509">この夢の先まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到梦想的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no yu me no sa ki ma de</span></p><p begin="01:33.907" end="01:39.211" itunes:key="L1510">一緒に進んで行こうね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们一起奔驰吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni su su n de i ko u ne</span></p><p begin="01:39.321" end="01:44.854" itunes:key="L1511">ねえ(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e</span></p><p begin="01:43.823" end="01:55.944" itunes:key="L1512">祈ってる(Wo...)いつまでも(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我祈祷着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:54.750" end="02:04.958" itunes:key="L1513">どこまでも(Wo...)みんなで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo</span></p><p begin="02:07.701" end="02:13.763" itunes:key="L1514">疲れて眠るキミ 肩にもたれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">疲惫地睡着的你 靠在我的肩上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ka re te ne mu ru ki mi ka ta ni mo ta re te</span></p><p begin="02:13.873" end="02:18.335" itunes:key="L1515">どんな夢 見ているのかな？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知你在做着怎样的美梦呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na yu me mi te i ru no ka na ?</span></p><p begin="02:18.603" end="02:21.944" itunes:key="L1516">頑張ってきたんだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来你都是那么竭尽全力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ga n ba 't te ki ta n da ne</span></p><p begin="02:21.954" end="02:26.093" itunes:key="L1517">小さな願い ほら 集めたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 若是将那些渺小的心愿一一收集</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na ne ga i ho ra a tsu me ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:26.103" end="02:29.263" itunes:key="L1518">きっと叶う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就必有得偿所愿的一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ka na u</span></p><p begin="02:29.073" end="02:34.971" itunes:key="L1519">(Wo...)このまま揺られていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样一路颠簸</span></p><p begin="02:34.581" end="02:40.415" itunes:key="L1520">(Wo...)キミのままでいてね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你就这样留在我身边</span></p><p begin="02:40.007" end="02:46.339" itunes:key="L1521">(Wo...)こんなところまで来たと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦到达这心驰神往的地方</span></p><p begin="02:46.572" end="02:53.093" itunes:key="L1522">目が覚めたとき きっと気付くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你睁眼醒来之时 必将有所察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ga sa me ta to ki ki 't to ki du ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:53.289" end="03:00.456" itunes:key="L1523">ほら 着いたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 我们已经到站了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra tsu i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:07.364" end="03:28.561" itunes:key="L1524">(Wo...)</p><p begin="03:52.687" end="03:58.402" itunes:key="L1525">同じ景色 見つめながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼中是如常的风景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji ke shi ki mi tsu me na ga ra</span></p><p begin="03:58.512" end="04:01.210" itunes:key="L1526">走り続ける Train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脚下是行驶的列车</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ri tsu du ke ru train</span></p><p begin="04:01.220" end="04:04.649" itunes:key="L1527">わたしたちを連れていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">载着我们通向未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi wo tsu re te i ku</span></p><p begin="04:04.659" end="04:09.398" itunes:key="L1528">この線路を選んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们选择了这条路线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no mi chi wo e ra n de</span></p><p begin="04:09.408" end="04:14.360" itunes:key="L1529">信じて 夢見ていた Train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚信不疑 踏上了梦寐以求的列车</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te yu me mi te i ta train</span></p><p begin="04:17.285" end="04:23.048" itunes:key="L1530">たとえ未来 不確かでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算未来还充满未知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e mi ra i fu ta shi ka de mo</span></p><p begin="04:23.058" end="04:25.753" itunes:key="L1531">走り続ける Train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这趟列车也会不断驶向未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ri tsu du ke ru train</span></p><p begin="04:25.763" end="04:29.202" itunes:key="L1532">いつか辿り着けばいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望将来总有一天能够抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ta do ri tsu ke ba i i</span></p><p begin="04:29.212" end="04:33.897" itunes:key="L1533">この夢の先まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到梦想的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no yu me no sa ki ma de</span></p><p begin="04:33.907" end="04:39.145" itunes:key="L1534">みんなで一緒に行こうね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们一起奔驰吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na de i 's sho ni i ko u ne</span></p><p begin="04:39.355" end="04:44.823" itunes:key="L1535">一緒に 進んで行こうね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往后也一起前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho ni su su n de i ko u ne</span></p><p begin="04:44.833" end="04:50.045" itunes:key="L1536">ねえ(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e</span></p><p begin="04:49.299" end="05:01.149" itunes:key="L1537">溢れだす(Wo...)思い出と(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将心中满溢的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re da su</span></p><p begin="05:00.175" end="05:11.996" itunes:key="L1538">切なさを(Wo...)だきしめて(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤感情绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se tsu na sa wo</span></p><p begin="05:11.067" end="05:23.273" itunes:key="L1539">祈ってる(Wo...)いつまでも(Wo...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我祈祷着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no 't te ru</span></p><p begin="05:21.981" end="05:32.430" itunes:key="L1540">どこまでも(Wo...)一緒に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo</span></p><p begin="05:34.959" end="05:38.366" itunes:key="L1541">肩が触れあってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们肩并肩前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta ga fu re a 't te ru</span></p><p begin="05:38.376" end="05:40.955" itunes:key="L1542">次の駅まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到抵达下一站</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu gi no e ki ma de</span></p><p begin="05:41.251" end="05:50.602" itunes:key="L1543">同じ夢をみさせて Train<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我和你看到同一个梦想吧 在这未来的列车上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yu me wo mi sa se te train</span></p></div></body></tt>